<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Sept real wages down 4.2pct yr/yr-KSH.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Sept real wages down 4.2pct yr/yr-KSH.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly average real wages at Hungary's non-agricultural enterprises were 4.2 percent lower in the January-September period than in the same period of last year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Real wages in the first eight months of this year were 4.5 percent down from the January-August period of 1995.</p>
<p>The average monthly net wage in the January-September period of 1996 amounted to 30,410 forints, up 19.5 percent from the same period of last year, the KSH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
